<details><summary>Reveal the separation argument</summary>
If two bounded traces agree, each generating word occurs in the other's trace. Thus each word is a prefix of the other, and mutual finite prefixes are equal.
</details>

## Coherence as a security budget

A cryptographic [hybrid argument](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_hopping) compares endpoints through local changes. Here each associator move is one local change. Adjust the local tolerance and watch the global estimate respond.

