<details><summary>Reveal the hybrid proof</summary>
For scores `p₀,…,pₙ`, the triangle inequality gives `|p₀−pₙ| ≤ Σᵢ|pᵢ−pᵢ₊₁|`. If every coherent step changes the score by at most `δ`, the endpoint gap is at most `nδ`.
</details>

## Inspect the finite law

The complete multiplication table can be viewed as a heat map. The outputs at `b∘a` and `a∘b` are the final steps producing the strict mismatch.

{{visualization:0}}

For background on weak categorical composition, consult the [bicategory overview](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bicategory). The present theory occupies the locally thin, one-object case, where coherence follows from uniqueness of parallel transformations.
